{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu-e-o004a","title":"孙权寝疾时征诸葛恪滕胤辅太子","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-92beb5079eb6199aa70d","label":"正文","text":"孙权寝疾时征诸葛恪滕胤辅太子","evidence":["santizhu-q-a8671dfa719ada9608d6"]},{"id":"santizhu064-a-0f53048ab485394171da","label":"正文","text":"孙权病重征诸葛恪等属以后事","evidence":["santizhu064-q-9738c31389ca10915f3b"]},{"id":"santizhu064-a-738cd4253778cb6470c4","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"峻表恪器任辅政权征恪","evidence":["santizhu064-q-0e7db2ae4b51bf6a222c"]},{"id":"santizhu064-a-28dd8c5d0b6e1165aa83","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"引恪受诏诸事一统于恪","evidence":["santizhu064-q-0af572f7d632a75c4086"]},{"id":"santizhu064-a-acef3aa935e1add61390","label":"正文","text":"权疾困，召恪、弘及太常滕胤、将军吕据、侍中孙峻，属以后事（孙弘以中书令领少傅）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-d14aaec4798e4c86c446"]},{"id":"santizhu064-a-d7ddfe2aa7da87eccbd2","label":"正文","text":"太元元年权寝疾，滕胤诣都留为太常，与诸葛恪等俱受遗诏辅政","evidence":["santizhu064-q-6e387014176f2cdc6a30"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"征诸葛恪、滕胤并令辅太子","evidence":["santizhu-q-a8671dfa719ada9608d6"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"受征为太子太傅并辅太子","evidence":["santizhu-q-a8671dfa719ada9608d6"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0005","role":"受征为太常并辅太子","evidence":["santizhu-q-a8671dfa719ada9608d6"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0127","role":"受召属以后事","evidence":["santizhu064-q-9738c31389ca10915f3b"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0075","role":"受召属以后事","evidence":["santizhu064-q-9738c31389ca10915f3b"]},{"person":"zhanggu-p0009","role":"以中书令领少傅，受召属以后事","evidence":["santizhu064-q-d14aaec4798e4c86c446"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-a8671dfa719ada9608d6"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-a8671dfa719ada9608d6","source_order":[48,4,0],"order":8422}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0005","name":"滕胤","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0075","name":"孙峻","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0127","name":"吕据","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhanggu-p0009","name":"孙弘","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-a8671dfa719ada9608d6","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-87c726d1b34c674ff45f","layer":"original","quote":"冬，权寝疾，征大将军诸葛恪为太子太傅，会稽太守滕胤为太常〖5〗：并受诏辅太子","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-0af572f7d632a75c4086","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-a6908d269427a618f174","layer":"pei","quote":"后引恪等见卧内，受诏床下。权诏曰：‘吾疾困矣。恐不复相见，诸事一以相委！’恪歔欷流涕曰：‘臣等皆受厚恩，当以死奉诏！愿陛下安精神，损思虑，无以外事为念。’权诏有司：诸事一统于恪；惟杀生大事，然后以闻。为治第馆，设陪卫。群官百司，拜揖之仪，各有品叙。诸法令有不便者，条列以闻，权辄听之。中外翕然，人怀欢欣","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-30fdc972641848aeb074","start":71,"end":222,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-0e7db2ae4b51bf6a222c","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-a6908d269427a618f174","layer":"pei","quote":"权寝疾，议所付托。时朝臣咸皆注意于恪，而孙峻表恪器任辅政，可付大事。权嫌恪刚狠自用；峻以当今朝臣皆莫及，遂固保之：乃征恪","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-30fdc972641848aeb074","start":10,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-6e387014176f2cdc6a30","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-9d25e64235c0d861b5e6","layer":"original","quote":"太元元年，权寝疾〖7〗。诣都〖8〗，留为太常，与诸葛恪等俱受遗诏辅政。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-9738c31389ca10915f3b","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-bb7af4361400a25e7d33","layer":"original","quote":"久之，权不豫〖1〗。而太子少，乃征恪以大将军领太子太傅〖2〗，中书令孙弘领少傅。权疾困，召恪、弘及太常滕胤、将军吕据、侍中孙峻，属以后事","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-d14aaec4798e4c86c446","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-bb7af4361400a25e7d33","layer":"original","quote":"久之，权不豫〖1〗。而太子少，乃征恪以大将军领太子太傅〖2〗，中书令孙弘领少傅。权疾困，召恪、弘及太常滕胤、将军吕据、侍中孙峻，属以后事。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
